ent-WeaponSubMachineGunC20rToy = C-20r toy
    .desc = The iconic syndicate weapon, now in a harmless edition — fires foam darts instead of live rounds. Still looks convincing enough to make your crewmates nervous. Uses .35 foam magazines.

ent-MagazinePistolSubMachineGunFoam = SMG magazine (.35 auto foam)
    .desc = A standard magazine for the toy C-20r, loaded with foam darts. The pink stripe gives it away.

uplink-c20r-toy-name = C-20r Toy
uplink-c20r-toy-desc = A replica of the infamous C-20r, firing foam darts instead of live rounds. Stuns targets briefly and deals minimal damage. Great for non-lethal takedowns — or just annoying your crewmates.

uplink-c20r-ammo-toy-name = C-20r Foam Magazine
uplink-c20r-ammo-toy-desc = A reload for the toy C-20r. Loaded with foam darts — the pink stripe makes them easy to spot. Won't kill anyone, but might sting a little.